\b 8. API Endpoints\b0\par
\b POST /api/chat/\b0 - Process a natural-language chat query and return business results.\par
\b GET /api/search/\b0 - Search businesses using query parameters.\par
\b GET /api/businesses/<id>/\b0 - Return details for one business.\par
\b GET /api/categories/\b0 - Return available business categories.\par
\b GET /api/areas/\b0 - Return available locations.\par
\b GET /health\b0 - Return application health status.\par\par
\b 9. Conclusion\b0\par
The project combines conversational AI, location-based search, and a structured business database to provide an easy-to-use local discovery service. Its natural-language interface, typo tolerance, distance-based filtering, and fallback processing make it practical for real-world users who may not use exact search terms.\par
